OL,4,CMajor Thanksgiving storm brings        
OL,5,Cflooding, flight delays across US      
OL,6,GA massive Thanksgiving storm hammering 
OL,7,Gthe Midwest and north-east with heavy  
OL,8,Grain and winds, along with high tides  
OL,9,Gout west, is causing widespread        
OL,10,Gdisruptions across the US.             
OL,12,FMore than 80 million Americans         
OL,13,Fexpected to be travelling this week.   
OL,14,FOn Thursday 460 flights in the US were 
OL,15,Fcancelled and another 2,508 flights    
OL,16,Finto, out of, or within the US were    
OL,17,Fdelayed, tracking site FlightAware     
OL,18,Fsaid.                                  
